      <description>Russian President Vladimir Putin has won another tactical and psychological victory in his quasi-war against NATO and the West. The skirmish took place at the airport of Leipzig, a large logistics hub that supplies NATO’s eastern flank and Ukraine, where German authorities last month defused an armed drone that was about to attack a Ukrainian aircraft parked nearby.</description>
