      <title>Melenchon and AfD Are Setting the Stage for an Epic Euro Fight</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-08/melenchon-and-afd-are-setting-the-stage-for-an-epic-euro-fight</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">50012eb874109d2cb688eaa3</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 04:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>This week the European Central Bank will meet to decide a probable interest-rate hike at a critical time for the euro economy. Rising headline inflation, not helped by the war in the Strait of Hormuz, will be uppermost on the rate setters’ minds. But their job is getting harder because of the surging support for populist parties in Germany and France.</description>
